 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">and</p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b><span lang="EN-GB">Hamilton‑Wentworth Regional Police Services Board, </span></b></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b><span lang="EN-GB">Jack Loft, Andrea McLaughlin, Joseph Stewart, Ian Matthews </span></b></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b><span lang="EN-GB">and Terry Hill</span></b></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">Respondents / Appellants on cross‑appeal</p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">‑ and ‑</p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b><span lang="EN-GB">Attorney General of Canada, Attorney General </span></b></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b><span lang="EN-GB">of Ontario, Aboriginal Legal Services of Toronto Inc., </span></b></p>
