-26.4pt"><i><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec504" target="_blank">Criminal Code<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span></i><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec504" target="_blank">, R.S.C. 1985, c.&nbsp;C‑46<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span><span lang="EN-GB"></span><span lang="EN-GB"></span><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec504" target="_blank">, ss.&nbsp;504<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec548subsec1" target="_blank">548(1)<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>(<i>a</i>), <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec696.1" target="_blank">696.1<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a> to <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-46-en#!fragment/sec696.6" target="_blank">696.6<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>.</span></p>
