 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:57.6pt;line-height:
200%"><i><span lang="EN-GB">Jonathan Rudin</span></i><span lang="EN-GB"> and <i>Kimberly&nbsp;R. Murray</i>, for the intervener the Aboriginal Legal Services of Toronto Inc.</span></p>
